{"id": "DeIZkAkP22m", "title": "Video by anchorlinedigital", "description": "Imagine waking up to a wall between you and your best friend.\n\nThat’s what happened in Berlin on August 13, 1961.\n\nFor 28 years, concrete, guard dogs and 302 watchtowers split one city in two. Almost 5,000 people escaped anyway. Over 138 didn’t make it.\n\nOn November 9, 1989, the gates finally opened. One year later, Germany was one country again.\n\nWant videos like this for your brand? Comment “VIDEO” and tell us what you want to make.\n\n#history #berlinwall #coldwar #animation #anchorlinedigital", "channel": "anchorlinedigital", "uploader_id": "25349745254", "uploader": "Anchorline", "timestamp": 1791243273, "like_count": 19, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4591754991152213a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.415, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMySaSKpWpDfoP1IBD4m8auvNMSUBWpVqYec5uxUjlP9pr3sCBQypri9atOdxAemVQzeZzhxL6kF_IEbPjkFLOOkWog4nEeg-FvhN4.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrIxqsDfSfZdjOkOEuAbv6q3GjhYonNGO94X7U13bc7a8o_xT1p75yQoJOFbuEAqlcrT6YgpedOS-RmSrQnHM3E&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=i7a3LPzVUF0Q7kNvwGuPbpX&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=OleJgyTEIWABXcM29Yv6nw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRAvqGY8Z6k_UGI60KBUKPeWD99TO97PtzIRwz-6P9gqQ&oe=6AF429C5", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 67.415, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.